Cell["R6. The bundled reproductions", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"8aab9237-feff-457c-bf4b-a3299e878cb6"],

Cell["\<\
rikyu_hpc a_submit_job, with p = launcher is not None, q = launcher != \
'mpirun', r = processes_per_node < 1: if p: (if q: return False; if r: return \
False). A job with no launcher and processes_per_node = 0 (the documented \
\"unset\") that fails elsewhere:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57665e39-ad4e-4aca-ac0f-a35b14854887"],

