Cell["\<\
In the real action q reads the local launcher, which the evaluator cannot \
bind, so 0.1.1 lists it as unevaluated; r reads a parameter and is named as a \
blocker. bio_opentrons a_open_thermocycler_lid, with p = the lid is open: if \
p: return state (idempotent), then open it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"47b53061-c323-4b7e-92d3-c0f3ac931a17"],

